  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="48.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 48.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gyf he man wundige, gebete þæt ⁊ gylde fulwite ðam hlaforde ⁊ æt ðam bisceope þa handa alyse oððon híg forlete.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If he wounds anyone, he shall make amends for doing so, and shall pay the full fine to the lord and redeem his lands from the bishop or lose them.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gif he man gewundige, gebete þæt ⁊ gylde fulwite þam hlaforde, ⁊ æt bisceope þa handa alyse oððe hig alæte.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
